    "scenesThatPass": [
      "HOLLY: If that were true, I'd already be pregnant. The DOORBELL RINGS. They suddenly stop. Share a quick kiss.\nHOLLY: Love you. Don't screw it up.\nSOCIAL WORKER: Hi there. I'm Diane Carter from Christian World Adoption.",
      "SOCIAL WORKER: OK, so here's how this works. I'll turn in your home study report, the agency will review it, then start the adoption process. Including mat…\nHOLLY: Right. The referral.\nSOCIAL WORKER: Exactly. And that can take up to six months. Then another six to nine months for the home country to process everything.",
      "JULES: What? I like the research. It soothes me.\nOBSTETRICIAN: Then you'll love uthe wall.\" See you two next month.",
      "TRISH: ...No, thank you. That's right, Breast is Best! Bye.\nJANICE: Oh Trish! Look at you, you're living your wisdom!\nTRISH: Landlines only from now on. Gotta protect my miracle.\nJANICE: Shame. I was really wanting an iPhone. Off the destroyed phone...",
      "HOLLY: ... So if anyone needs help with a nursery or just getting organized, I can take care of all of that.\nTRISH: Sure. Leave them on the counter.\nHOLLY: Great. Thank you so much. And congratulations.\nTRISH: Oh thanks. It's - - OH! There's a kick, OK. A moving baby is a healthy baby!"
    ]
  },
